     "position": 3
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "@id": "http://localhost:8080/2-movers-cost/#faq",
   "@type": "FAQPage",
   "mainEntity": [
    {
     "@type": "Question",
     "acceptedAnswer": {
      "@type": "Answer",
      "text": "Often, yes. Hourly rates follow what movers pay their crews and what a truck costs to run, and both tend to be higher in California's big cities than in most of Texas. The ranges on this page are national planning figures, so what 2 movers cost in an expensive city can sit at the top of them, and in a smaller town nearer the bottom."
     },
     "name": "Do 2 movers cost more in California than in Texas?"
    },
    {
     "@type": "Question",
     "acceptedAnswer": {
      "@type": "Answer",
      "text": "A calculator gives a planning range for a move like yours, not a price. The final bill depends on the hours the crew works, the minimum, any travel charge and extras such as stairs. A written estimate after a mover has seen your things, in person or by video, is the firm figure for what 2 movers cost; use the range to spot a quote that's far too high or too low."
     },
     "name": "How close is a 2 movers cost calculator estimate to the final bill?"
    },
    {
     "@type": "Question",
     "acceptedAnswer": {
      "@type": "Answer",
      "text": "Hidden costs push what 2 movers cost above the rate times the hours, and most are time: the drive to your door, waiting for keys or an elevator, and boxes still open when the crew arrives. Some movers add a trip or fuel fee, a charge for packing materials they use, or a fee for heavy items. Ask for each in writing, so what 2 movers cost on the day matches the quote."
     },
     "name": "What are the hidden costs of hiring 2 movers?"
    },
    {
     "@type": "Question",
     "acceptedAnswer": {
      "@type": "Answer",
      "text": "Tipping is up to you, and guides suggest tipping each mover rather than handing one sum to the crew. Give it to each person directly, so both get their share. The tip calculator on this page works out what guides suggest on top of what 2 movers cost, by the hour or by the day."
     },
     "name": "Is one tip enough for a crew of 2 movers?"
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}